        "detailed_description": "<strong>Made for VR. Memories feel closer here.</strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden Memories of The Gardens Between</i> is a tranquil single-player adventure-puzzle game about time, memory and friendship.  With twice the content of the original, Hidden Memories invites you to unlock Arina's personal diary and solve 40+ new puzzles — woven seamlessly into a deeper, more intimate journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S NEW IN HIDDEN MEMORIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 40+ New Puzzles – Delightfully inventive puzzles designed exclusively for VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Vibrant Art Style – Beautiful, storybook-inspired islands that you can now visit yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 An Expanded Award-Winning Narrative – Delve deeper with Arina’s illustrated diary offering new insights and perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Whimsical VR Interactions – Deepen your connection to the story with intuitive, hands-on gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Comfortably Immerse Yourself – Relax in serene islands seated or standing with no pressure, fail-states, or complex UI.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control time itself to solve puzzles built from the emotional architecture of memory.  Move time with your hands as dreamlike islands revolve before you — each one a sculpted memory, built from the emotions and objects that shaped Arina and Frendt’s past. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ Manipulate time to solve puzzles and reach the apex of each isle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play retro video games, wield paintbrushes, and dig for dino bones at the museum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Interact with objects to solve puzzles - from childhood toys to symbolic tools of self-expression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌙 Discover surreal dreamscapes where every detail carries emotional weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☑️ Playtime for most players: Roughly 4 - 8 hours depending on puzzle solving confidence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NARRATIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through Arina’s evolving diary, experience the subtle, sometimes bittersweet shifts of a childhood bond growing older. Each island captures a turning point, a feeling, or a forgotten moment—rendered in vivid color and texture. Explore themes of memory, growth, and the spaces between people.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper into the story through Arina's diary entries and artistic evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the moments that defined their friendship—and changed them forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the past with new perspective, in a world made to be felt as much as seen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCOLADES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of 14 awards, including: 'Game of the Year', Webby 'Best Puzzles', and the 'Apple Design Award', as well as twenty more international nominations including IGF 'Excellence in Visual Art'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Memories (VR) praised by press: 9/10 Gaming Trend, 8/10 , 8/10 GeekGasm, 8.5/10 The VR Realm, 8/10 Use A Potion, 8/10 IndieGames.eu, 7.5/10 PixelByteGaming, 8.5/10 MKAU Gaming.</p></li></ul>",
